fonts/NotoSansArabic-Regular.ttf is not part of the resvg corpus. text/direction/rtl lists
"Noto Sans Arabic" first, and its reference draws the Arabic in that face, which neither the
snapshot nor resvg v0.49.0 ships. The file is the unhinted Regular face from the
NotoSansArabic-v2.010 release of https://github.com/notofonts/arabic, and
fonts/NotoSansArabic-LICENSE-OFL.txt is that release's OFL.txt (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
Each release's unhinted Regular was compared with that reference on the full text tier (default
threshold, 100-pixel limit): v2.010 differs by 71 pixels and v2.011 by 69, while v2.012 and
v2.013 differ by 718 each. Neither of the later two matches the reference, so the pin must not
move past v2.011; v2.010 is kept as the oldest release that matches.

  https://github.com/notofonts/arabic/releases/download/NotoSansArabic-v2.010/NotoSansArabic-v2.010.zip
  SHA256: a5a34ac1ea01d0d71c083f99440ebfb1f64224474a0d88bb7ef0e2f8d9a996d2

  NotoSansArabic/unhinted/ttf/NotoSansArabic-Regular.ttf -> fonts/NotoSansArabic-Regular.ttf
  SHA256: 81af59793116d576dd304caea4fded81123ba0bbd79ef513403c5cf0924d9f40

  ../OFL.txt -> fonts/NotoSansArabic-LICENSE-OFL.txt
  SHA256: 07fc70bfeb985cc1a87a8587d0a0c80bab11c86c9dc3fd95b6f0cb332f983e96
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

exports_files([
    "LICENSE",
    "fonts/Noto-LICENSE-OFL.txt",
    "resources/ub.png",
    "results.csv",
])

filegroup(
    name = "tests",
    srcs = glob([
        "tests/**/*.svg",
        "tests/**/*.png",
    ]),
)

filegroup(
    name = "resources",
    srcs = glob(
        ["resources/**"],
        allow_empty = True,
        exclude = ["resources/README.md"],
    ),
)

filegroup(
    name = "fonts",
    srcs = glob(
        [
            "fonts/*.ttf",
            "fonts/*.otf",
        ],
        allow_empty = True,
    ),
)
